review(723,['b13-zero','b13-zeroofficial','b13-hercules'],'The Muses narrate Hercules\' professional rise in one montage.',['Zero to Hero is the fame montage.','Go the Distance is Hercules\' early belonging solo.','I Won\'t Say concerns Meg\'s romance, not his rise.','A Star Is Born celebrates the finale, not the rise montage.'],'A Star Is Born is also sung by the Muses; distinguished the rise-to-fame montage from the final celebration.','q69 asks the chorus group, q711 the early solo; different facts.')
